# Railway redeploy log

Each line is a manual Railway redeploy trigger from this repo. Railway's
git-watch on `main` picks up the merge commit and starts a fresh build.

This file exists so the trigger has a real diff (otherwise PRs can't be
opened) and so we have a record of when forced redeploys were needed.

- 2026-06-01 — main was ahead of the running Railway deploy; manual trigger.
